  "content": "\n\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/563928/description_8b75b5f3-9883-4d6c-b3e8-b6d98a89fa51.png\" alt=\"TerraBlender 标志\" width=\"336\" height=\"160\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/563928/description_97be718f-501b-4058-bf35-a59c798f3631.png\" alt=\"Glitchfiend 标志\" width=\"165\" height=\"34\"> &nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252fnet%252fminecraftforge%252fforge%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/563928/description_283579fd-370d-4cea-9dbb-fbd374e5bb7c.png\" alt=\"Forge 标志\" width=\"174\" height=\"32\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/GyyzU6T\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/563928/description_ac771a61-5607-4adf-ad96-3d8e16a42010.png\" alt=\"加入我们的 Discord\" width=\"212\" height=\"38\"></a></p>\n<h1>简介</h1>\n<hr>\n<h4>TerraBlender 是一款库模组，用于以简单且兼容的方式配合 Minecraft 的新生物群系/地形系统添加生物群系。</h4>\n<p style=\"font-size:1px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h1>开发者</h1>\n<hr>\n<h3>关于如何使用 TerraBlender API 的文档可在 <a href=\"https://github.com/Glitchfiend/TerraBlender/wiki/Getting-started\" rel=\"nofollow\">TerraBlender Wiki</a> 找到</h3>\n<p style=\"font-size:1px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h1>相关链接</h1>\n<hr>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://twitter.com/TheAdubbz\" rel=\"nofollow\">在 Twitter 上关注我</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://www.paypal.com/donate/?business=AdubbzG@gmail.com&item_name=TerraBlender (from CurseForge.com)&cy_code=USD\" rel=\"nofollow\">通过 PayPal 捐赠</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Adubbz\" rel=\"nofollow\">在 Patreon 上支持我</a></strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"font-size:1px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h1>其他加载器版本</h1>\n<hr>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/terrablender-neoforge\" rel=\"nofollow\">适用于 NeoForge 的 TerraBlender</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/terrablender-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">适用于 Fabric 的 TerraBlender</a></strong></li>\n</ul>",
